  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-19 (in session): option (b), in PR 3 (the stable-id v16 bump): a new scheme constant for the stand-in fingerprint in identity_schemes.py, its label derived via value_label (e.g. hgstandinfp1:), minted by mint_stand_in_fingerprint; ADR-0035 section 7's table and the spec's fingerprint bullet updated. Stable ids do not move; only language=None fingerprint values change."  # 0f50
- op: discuss  # c135
